			"locked": false,
			"text": "Repo/GitHub create: validate metadata/sidecars,\nsave manifest/index; stage id becomes repo root.\nPR: validate metadata summary/base ZIP id;\nchanged bytes live in compact ZIP.\nMerge/mirror sync: validate metadata/base ZIP id;\nmove repo ZIP + save index/thread.",
