			"locked": false,
			"text": "Append records are UUID-idempotent materialization inputs; high-frequency\nthread writes avoid repo-index rewrites until compaction. Mutable JSON uses\nexpectedVersion/retry for settings, watches, cleanup, merge, and backup status.",
			"fontSize": 15,
			"fontFamily": 2,
